IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CHUNKED-PREFILL-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 PREFILL-TOKENS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 DECODE-TOKENS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 QUOTA-LIMIT         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 QUOTA-CHUNKS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CHUNKED-PREFILL-V2.
    IF QUOTA-LIMIT == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE PREFILL-TOKENS TO QUOTA-CHUNKS.
    ADD DECODE-TOKENS TO QUOTA-CHUNKS.
    DIVIDE QUOTA-LIMIT INTO QUOTA-CHUNKS.
    IF QUOTA-CHUNKS == 0
        MOVE 1 TO QUOTA-CHUNKS.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 QUOTA-CHUNKS.
    WEIGHT 30 QUOTA-LIMIT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
